{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d0e7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a07b1e-f583-7cc2-a513-9b90d8c833d2"},"sequence":1742,"recorded_at":1780531400003479,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"8cd64a8a-faf9-439f-ae7d-60151e219433","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"8cd64a8a-faf9-439f-ae7d-60151e219433","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"8cd64a8a-faf9-439f-ae7d-60151e219433"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"bad00810-f111-4733-a0ac-10142cb70082"},"task_id":"bad00810-f111-4733-a0ac-10142cb70082","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"bad00810-f111-4733-a0ac-10142cb70082","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-57-1\",\n  \"command\": \"head -n 15 LOGBOOK.md\",\n  \"description\": \"Check logbook head format\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"# Flight Logbook\\n\\n> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\\n> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\\n\\n## 2026-09-07\\n\\n### 1215 — 33xcnc: remaining environment copies converged, residue re-derived, 54/55 battery\\n- SCOPE: TASK-260906-33xcnc (story final leaf). Production: `sessadapter/decode.go` + `dirnode/decode.go` (9 Check*/measure/extensions helpers each delegate to `environ.*`, 6 grammar vars deleted, rawUint53 trailing arm + ladder empty-guard hardened to the environ texture), grammar call sites (`sessadapter/manifest.go`, `tuple.go`, `probe.go`, `dirnode/probe.go`, `query.go`), `provhost/opdecode.go` (same trailing arm), `environ/decode.go` (ladder guard, refuse func→var). No leaf-owned production touched (`provhost/protocol.go`, `identity.go`, `probe.go`, `canonicaljson/closed_shapes.go` frozen). Tests: scalar agreement battery (15 vectors), site audit (31 sites/39 rules, TestMain swap + recorder), census alias audit (import-alias/var-binding/dot-import/shadow plants), delegation pins, sibling trailing units, ladder/array units.\\n- FINDING (ladder hole, caught by the new unit pre-fix): `parseUint53Literal(\\\"\\\")` admitted 0 in all three packages; unreachable via rawUint53 (guarded) but hardened identically everywhere.\\n- FINDING (union coverage): in-package + external test files compile to one binary, so the TestMain audit sees exercised sites from both; the in-package driver table is load-bearing for the two frame-fault passthrough sites (external corpora carry no frame-faulty tuple/observation bodies). Proven: dropping one passthrough driver fails the closed rule set (`want exactly 39 codes, observed 38`).\\n- FINDING (mutant quality): M13n v1 (presence skip without decode skip) survived — the nil member refuses at decode fall-through. v2 (with `continue`) kills. R_rawstringerr predicted-survivor was wrong: direct-rawString arms (platform/arch/version/provider) refuse at the wrong arm, killed by exact-text drivers.\\n- EVIDENCE: outcome `TASK-260906-33xcnc_outcome.md` + battery log + mutants JSON + harness + mutant table (54 killed/55 applied on denominator 90 = 31 refuse + 59 bool; 34 narrowing incl. T1/C3 token-preserving raw-scans; 3 census-only; 1 audit-only; 1 predicted survivor R_digestnonstr with downstream-hold bound; H1/H2 prove NOT_APPLIED/COMPILE_FAIL rows). Callerless closed for 10 Check* symbols via delegation; DecodeTuple/DecodeEnvironmentObservation/rawUint53/Fault.Error/HasLoneSurrogateEscape re-stated with reasons.\\n- GATES: `go test ./...` exit 0 (23 ok), `-race` exit 0 (environ/sessadapter/dirnode/scalar/provhost/canonicaljson/provider; full-repo race not run), `-cover` exit 0 (env 92.4/sess 82.0/dir 87.7/ph 86.0/scalar 90.1), `go vet` + `GOOS=windows go vet` + both builds exit 0, gofmt clean, tracecheck exit 0, catalog current, cigate selections exit 0, fuzz smoke 13/13.\\n- STATUS: Ready for review, handed off to review. Open need (in outcome, no board element): provhost decoder convergence needs unfreezing `provhost/protocol.go`.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3026,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 757,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
